/* The icon Windows shows for this program: in Explorer, on the taskbar, and on
   the Start-menu shortcut the installer makes. It is a resource compiled into
   the executable rather than a file beside it, because that is the only place
   Explorer looks — and Qt's Windows plugin takes the window icon from the same
   resource, so the title bar gets it for free.

   Generated by CMake from `app.rc.in` with an absolute path filled in: a
   relative one is resolved against the resource compiler's working directory,
   which is the build tree, and neither `windres` nor `rc.exe` would find it
   there. */
1 ICON "@SC_WINDOWS_ICON@"
